OpenChat is distributed under more than one licence. Each package states its
licence in the "license" field of its package.json.

  AGPL-3.0-or-later   Server components: services/api, apps/dashboard,
                      packages/core, realtime, email, database, auth, ui,
                      tooling/*
                      Full text: LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt

  Apache-2.0          Client components: apps/widget,
                      packages/api-client, api-contracts,
                      notification-protocol, shared
                      Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

The reasons are recorded in docs/architecture/decisions/0011-license-boundaries.md.
The iPhone app and the notification relay are no longer part of this repository.
Copies of them from earlier commits keep the licences stated there. See
docs/architecture/decisions/0019-app-and-relay-leave-open-source.md.
Contributions are accepted under the same licence as the package they change,
using the Developer Certificate of Origin. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
